  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Arctic National Wildlife Refuge Coastline 1:63360",
  "description": "Data Type: ; This dataset depicts the greater Arctic National Wildlife Refuge coastline at a sourcescale of 1:63360. This dataset was derived from USGS 1:63360 scale maps combined with data from the ESRI Digital Chart of the World, Alaska subset. The attributes associated with this ARC/INFO dataset are identical to those of the Digital Chart of the World. The final dataset is in an Albers Equal Area map projection.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: This dataset provides a large scale depiction of the coastline for the 1002 study area of ANWR. This dataset will be used with other data layers to perform resource analysis.",
